{"4968510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brew & Defend", "steam_appid": 4968510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5033680], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew &amp; Defend</strong> is a tavern management game with tower defense mechanics. Build your supply chain and satisfy waves of demanding customers before they walk out and ruin your reputation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/extras/dff4104c3ca6f1d6d01281b64f4ce573.poster.avif?t=1787741750\" width=780 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/extras/dff4104c3ca6f1d6d01281b64f4ce573.webm?t=1787741750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/extras/dff4104c3ca6f1d6d01281b64f4ce573.mp4?t=1787741750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Brew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of defense towers, build fields to harvest ingredients, processors to brew beverages and bake bread, and shops to sell your goods. Balance your production lines in real-time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfy Demands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers have different cravings, from simple beer to premium wine and meat. Place shops along the path strategically to optimize service and prevent bottlenecks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the chaos:</strong> Can you survive escalating rushes and satisfy customer demands?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming &amp; Brewing:</strong> Grow barley, hops, honey, grapes, plums, and pigs to make beer, bread, wine, mead, pies, sausages and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply Balancing:</strong> Track expenses, sales, and missed resources in real-time logs to prevent bankruptcy.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew &amp; Defend</strong> is a tavern management game with tower defense mechanics. Build your supply chain and satisfy waves of demanding customers before they walk out and ruin your reputation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/extras/dff4104c3ca6f1d6d01281b64f4ce573.poster.avif?t=1787741750\" width=780 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/extras/dff4104c3ca6f1d6d01281b64f4ce573.webm?t=1787741750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/extras/dff4104c3ca6f1d6d01281b64f4ce573.mp4?t=1787741750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Brew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of defense towers, build fields to harvest ingredients, processors to brew beverages and bake bread, and shops to sell your goods. Balance your production lines in real-time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfy Demands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers have different cravings, from simple beer to premium wine and meat. Place shops along the path strategically to optimize service and prevent bottlenecks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the chaos:</strong> Can you survive escalating rushes and satisfy customer demands?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming &amp; Brewing:</strong> Grow barley, hops, honey, grapes, plums, and pigs to make beer, bread, wine, mead, pies, sausages and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply Balancing:</strong> Track expenses, sales, and missed resources in real-time logs to prevent bankruptcy.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Brew &amp; Defend is a medieval tavern management game with tower defense mechanics. Build your supply chain, grow crops, brew beverages, and place taverns along the road to satisfy a parade of thirsty customers before they ruin your reputation!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/e0bf9bbb24a1068ec7f970dee2c90b40b2e75284/header.jpg?t=1787741750", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/a16e2dd373b6979e9c249afd45990f08ef025710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787741750", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968510/a16e2dd373b6979e9c249afd45990f08ef025710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787741750", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2nd Gen / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics supporting OpenGL 3.3 (Intel HD 4000 / AMD Radeon HD series or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6th Gen / AMD Ryzen 3 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics: